        <mxCell id="IdE0zEKYAKmfSanEo9sJ-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Functional Requirements:&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create a short url from a long url&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;optinally support the custom alias&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;optionaly support an expiration time&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Be redirected to original url from the short url&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Non Functional Requirements:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Low latency on redirects(~200ms)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scale to 100DAu and 1B urls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ensure uniqueness of the short code&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;High Availability eventual consistency&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
